Smart Employee Attrition & Performance Management System

Overview  
This project is a full-stack web application designed to manage employee data, track performance, and predict employee attrition risk using rule-based logic. It provides a centralized system for HR teams to efficiently handle employee records and make informed decisions.

<img width="1917" height="865" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11884c0c-8340-4bb4-a581-02a572d4cff8" />

Objective  
The goal of this project is to build a scalable employee management system that not only performs CRUD operations but also analyzes employee performance and identifies potential attrition risks.

Technology Stack  

Frontend  
React (Vite)  
Axios  
React Router  

Backend  
Node.js  
Express.js  

Database  
MongoDB  

Authentication  
JWT (JSON Web Token)  
bcrypt for password hashing  

Features  

User Authentication  
User registration and login functionality  
Secure password hashing using bcrypt  
JWT-based authentication  

Employee Management  
Add new employees  
View employee list  
Update employee details  
Delete employee records  

Performance Tracking  
Track attendance percentage  
Store performance ratings  

Attrition Risk Detection  
The system uses rule-based logic to determine employee risk level:

If attendance < 50 and rating < 2 → High Risk  
If attendance < 70 and rating < 3 → Medium Risk  
Otherwise → Low Risk  

Dashboard  
Displays total number of employees  
Shows count of high-risk, medium-risk, and low-risk employees  
Provides quick insights for HR decision-making  

Employee Fields  
Name  
Role  
Department  
Salary  
Attendance  
Rating  
Date of Joining (optional)  
Experience (optional)  

